  "description": "UW ROM sample slicer: SMPL 1..48 UW ROM slots; MODE cuts the sample into SLIC slices (EQUA equal, EXP longer along, LOG shorter along, SED1-4 Perlin-noise seeds), SLNO picks the slice; DEC 0 plays it once, 1..126 decay while PLAY FWD/REV/BI loops it, 127 loops forever; TIME slows the playhead with SMP-ST's splice stretch (grain 64) at unchanged pitch; PTCH +-32 semitones"
